  "keyFeatures": [
    "Intelligent user grouping by profession, location, and expertise across neighborhood-to-global scales",
    "Real-time group chat with polls, elections, reactions, and threaded discussions",
    "Project submission and community investment with transparent review workflows",
    "NajmBahar integrated financial system with sub-accounts, peer transfers, and membership fees",
    "NajmHoda AI assistant for answering questions and autonomous platform operations",
    "Multilingual support (English and Persian) with Jalali calendar",
    "Support ticket system with file attachments and staff responses",
    "Reputation and reputation-conversion system",
    "Google OAuth and email-based authentication with multi-step registration"
